OL,3,AHealey pledges growth but acknowledges
OL,4,Ahigh government borrowing costs in
OL,5,Afirst speech as chancellor
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn his first speech as chancellor, John
OL,8,FHealey says Britain's growth trajectory
OL,9,Fhas been weak but changing this is
OL,10,F"central" to his purpose
OL,12,FHe also acknowledges that government
OL,13,Fborrowing costs are at "historic
OL,14,Fhighs", blaming "high borrowing and low
OL,15,Fgrowth" which he says has allowed
OL,16,Fnational debt to rise to almost 100% of
OL,17,FGDP
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
