OL,3,AHealey pledges growth but acknowledges
OL,4,Ahigh government borrowing costs in
OL,5,Afirst speech as chancellor
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealey also announces plans to allocate
OL,8,F#150m to fast-growing firms in the
OL,9,Fnorth of England and to create the
OL,10,F"northern 500", bringing together "the
OL,11,FNorth's most ambitious mid-sized
OL,12,Fbusinesses" in a group led by mayors
OL,14,FJust last week, UK borrowing costs rose
OL,15,Fagain, with interest rates on 10-year
OL,16,Fdebt reaching an 18-year high - this
OL,17,Fgraph shows the latest figures
OL,19,FHealey will deliver his first Budget on
OL,20,F28 October - which, he says, will be
OL,21,F"built on fiscal discipline"
